                <h3>Before Your Appointment</h3>
                <p>To help us process your insurance claim efficiently, please:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Bring your insurance card to every visit</li>
                    <li>Bring a valid photo ID</li>
                    <li>Know your copay amount</li>
                    <li>Inform us of any insurance changes</li>
                    <li>Contact your insurance to verify dermatology benefits</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Understanding Your Coverage</h3>
                <p>Coverage varies by plan and procedure. Here's what to know:</p>
                
                <h4>Medical Dermatology</h4>
                <p>Most insurance plans cover medical dermatology services, including treatment for:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Skin cancer screenings and treatment</li>
                    <li>Acne treatment</li>
                    <li>Eczema and psoriasis</li>
                    <li>Rashes and infections</li>
                    <li>Mole evaluations</li>
                    <li>Other medical skin conditions</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h4>Cosmetic Services</h4>
                <p>Cosmetic procedures are typically not covered by insurance, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Botox and dermal fillers (when cosmetic)</li>
                    <li>Cosmetic chemical peels</li>
                    <li>Cosmetic laser treatments</li>
                    <li>Elective skin rejuvenation</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Payment Options</h3>
                <p>We offer multiple payment options for your convenience:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Cash</li>
                    <li>Personal checks</li>
                    <li>Credit cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover)</li>
                    <li>Health Savings Account (HSA)</li>
                    <li>Flexible Spending Account (FSA)</li>
                    <li>CareCredit financing</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Self-Pay Patients</h3>
                <p>If you don't have insurance or prefer to pay out-of-pocket, we offer competitive self-pay rates. Please contact our office for pricing information.</p>
                
                <h3>Financial Questions?</h3>
                <p>Our billing team is here to help! If you have questions about insurance coverage, payment plans, or costs, please don't hesitate to call us at <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
